  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1122.01 Availability of Alternative Dispute Resolution. Alternative dispute resolution shall be voluntary and available to parents and LEAs in accordance with RSA 186-C:23 and 34 CFR 300.506.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
